  "description": "Once a top-tier idol, Ju-Won is now forced to watch as his juniors steal the spotlight. Desperate to save his dying career, he tracks down the high-profile sponsor backing the industry’s rising rookies: Madam Noh. But the woman behind the power isn't interested in the usual games. Stripped of his pride and faced with her cold, direct demands, Ju-Won must decide how far he’s willing to go to stay in the limelight. The stage has changed, and the only audience that matters now is her.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
